  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      261.29,
      401.9,
      284.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      296.33,
      401.88,
      331.07
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Assistance to andProtection of Victims of Crime and Witnesses (Amendment)Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      343.13,
      401.88,
      377.87
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 31 of the Assistance to and Protection ofVictims of Crime and Witnesses Act, No. 4 of 2015 is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      389.93,
      401.87,
      424.67
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution for the words \u201cwithin Sri Lanka,\u201d , ofthe words \u201cwithin or outside Sri Lanka,\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      436.73,
      401.86,
      459.83
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the insertion immediately after subsection (1)of that section, of the following new subsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      471.89,
      401.89,
      553.43
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1A) Where any evidence or statement of anyvictim of crime or witness is to be recorded fromany remote location outside Sri Lanka undersubsection (1), it shall be recorded at the Sri Lankandiplomatic mission in the country from where suchvictim of crime or witness seeks to testify or makethe statement.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      565.49,
      401.87,
      600.23
    ],
    "text": "(3)by the repeal of subsection (4) of that section, andthe substitution therefor, of the followingsubsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      210.81,
      612.29,
      366.11,
      623.63
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(4) For the purposes of this section\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      225.57,
      635.69,
      401.86,
      670.55
    ],
    "text": "(a) \u201cCourt\u201d means a Court before whichany criminal proceedings are beingconducted; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
